  "source": "; Sort three 32-bit words using compare and swap\nSET r0, 8\nSET r1, 3\nSET r2, 5\nCMP r0, r1\nJC swap01\nJMP compare12\nswap01: MOV r3, r0\nMOV r0, r1\nMOV r1, r3\ncompare12: CMP r1, r2\nJC swap12\nJMP compare01\nswap12: MOV r3, r1\nMOV r1, r2\nMOV r2, r3\ncompare01: CMP r0, r1\nJC swapfinal\nJMP save\nswapfinal: MOV r3, r0\nMOV r0, r1\nMOV r1, r3\nsave: ST r0, 0x100\nST r1, 0x104\nST r2, 0x108\nHALT\n",
